## Code style

**Every function gets exactly one single-line comment immediately above it, stating what it does.**
No multi-paragraph docstrings, no JSDoc blocks with `@param`/`@returns` tags, no comment restating
the function name.

**Python (backend, ml)** — type hints on all signatures · `black` (88) · `isort` ·
`logging`, never `print()`

**JavaScript (extension)** — `const`/`let`, never `var` · `async`/`await`, not `.then()` chains ·
no stray `console.log` in committed code

**TypeScript (dashboard)** — strict mode · no `any` · all API response types in
`dashboard/lib/types.ts` · this is **Next.js 16**, not 14 — see `dashboard/AGENTS.md`

## Commit format

```
feat(sprint-N): <task id> — <description>
fix(sprint-N): <what was broken>
test(sprint-N): add tests for <component>
docs: update ROADMAP.md / PROJECT_STATE.md
```
